{
  "title": "Adductor Strain",
  "url": "https://www.orthobullets.com/knee-and-sports/3101/adductor-strain",
  "subtitle": "Updated: Jun 1 2021",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "summary",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "An adductor strain is a common injury to the adductor muscle group that occurs as a result of forceful hip extension & external rotation of an abducted leg.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Diagnosis is made clinically with groin pain with tenderness over the inferior pubic rami and decreased strength with resisted leg adduction compared to the other leg.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment is nonoperative with rest, NSAIDs and protected weight bearing.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Epidemiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Incidence",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "occurs in 10-30% of soccer and hockey players",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Pathophysiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Mechanism",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "a “pulled groin,” is caused by forceful hip extension & external rotation of an abducted leg.",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Occurs due to strong eccentric contraction of adductors during play",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "-1",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
